DB Period: SE Population used;

All Treated Participants Set=all participants who received at least 1 dose of satralizumab in DB \& OLE period.

As pre-specified in SAP, AEs were reported for DB period \& OST period. OST includes data for all participants from 1st dose of satralizumab (in DB for participants receiving satralizumab \& in OLE for participants receiving placebo in DB) up to 4 weeks after the last dose (if discontinued), or last contact with participant, whatever occurred first.
